iption\":\"The 'Gather Intelligence' activity represents the process of collecting information from various sources for intelligence purposes.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Analyze Data\",\"description\":\"The 'Analyze Data' activity involves examining and interpreting collected data to extract meaningful insights.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"An 'Analyze Data' activity must be followed by an 'Identify Threats' activity at some point later in the same process instance. Conversely, an 'Identify Threats' event can occur only if an 'Analyze Data' event has occurred before it within the same process instance. This bidirectional and ordered dependency ensures that 'Analyze Data' imposes obligations for future 'Identify Threats', and 'Identify Threats' cannot occur without prior 'Analyze Data'. Multiple 'Analyze Data' and 'Identify Threats' are allowed, with each 'Analyze Data' eventually leading to an 'Identify Threats' and each 'Identify Threats' being justified by a preceding 'Analyze Data'.\",\"template\":\"Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Analyze Data\",\"description\":\"The 'Analyze Data' activity involves examining and interpreting collected data to extract meaningful insights.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Identify Threats\",\"description\":\"The 'Identify Threats' activity involves detecting and recognizing potential threats based on analyzed information.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Identify Threats' activity is permitted to occur only if a 'Develop Strategies' activity has occurred before it within the same process instance.\",\"template\":\"Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Develop Strategies\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Strategies' activity involves formulating plans and approaches to address identified threats.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Identify Threats\",\"description\":\"The 'Identify Threats' activity involves detecting and recognizing potential threats based on analyzed information.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Strategies' activity can occur only if it is immediately preceded by an 'Implement Countermeasures' activity, with no other activities occurring in between.\",\"template\":\"Chain Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Implement Countermeasures\",\"description\":\"The 'Implement Countermeasures' activity involves executing actions designed to mitigate or neutralize identified threats.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Develop Strategies\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Strategies' activity involves formulating plans and approaches to address identified threats.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"Whenever an 'Implement Countermeasures' activity occurs, it must be immediately followed by a 'Monitor Activity' activity in the next event position, with no other events in between. The 'Monitor Activity' activity is allowed to happen isolated.\",\"template\":\"Chain Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Implement Countermeasures\",\"description\":\"The 'Implement Countermeasures' activity involves executing actions designed to mitigate or neutralize identified threats.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Activity\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Activity' activity involves continuously observing and tracking ongoing situations or countermeasure effects.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Monitor Activity' activity occurs, then a 'Report Findings' activity must occur after that 'Monitor Activity' event and before any subsequent 'Monitor Activity' occurs. No other occurrence of 'Monitor Activity' is allowed between a 'Monitor Activity' and 'Report Findings'.\",\"template\":\"Alternate Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Activity\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Activity' activity involves continuously observing and tracking ongoing situations or countermeasure effects.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Report Findings\",\"description\":\"The 'Report Findings' activity involves documenting and communicating the results of the intelligence process.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Review Intelligence' activity can occur only if it was immediately preceded by a 'Disseminate Information' activity, and no other 'Disseminate Information' event is allowed between that 'Disseminate Information' and the 'Review Intelligence'.\",\"template\":\"Alternate Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Review Intelligence\",\"description\":\"The 'Review Intelligence' activity involves examining and validating gathered intelligence for accuracy and completeness.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Disseminate Information\",\"description\":\"The 'Disseminate Information' activity involves distributing finalized intelligence to relevant stakeholders.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Disseminate Information' must be the last activity to occur in the process.\",\"template\":\"End\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Disseminate Information\",\"description\":\"The 'Disseminate Information' activity involves distributing finalized intelligence to relevant stakeholders.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If 'Gather Intelligence' activity occurs, then 'Analyze Data' must also occur in the same process instance, and vice-versa.\",\"template\":\"Co-Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Gather Intelligence\",\"description\":\"The 'Gather Intelligence' activity represents the process of collecting information from various sources for intelligence purposes.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Analyze Data\",\"description\":\"The 'Analyze Data' activity involves examining and interpreting collected data to extract meaningful insights.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null}]}"